{"id":"e4ed3aef037b32e0","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-occam-learning.md","title":"Finite Hypothesis Class Generalization","display":"thm-occam-learning — Finite Hypothesis Class Generalization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-occam-learning","aliases":["28-thm-occam-learning","Finite-Class Occam Bound"],"display":"thm-occam-learning — Finite Hypothesis Class Generalization","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, p.59 footnote 7 learning note; local finite-class union-bound proof","source_printed_pages":"59","source_pdf_pages":"85","source_statement_verified":false,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"proof_status":"local-proof-reviewed","source_reference_before_R6":"p.66 learning note; printed 66 / PDF 92"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-occam-learning"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-occam-learning</span><span>Finite-Class Occam Bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-occam-learning — Finite Hypothesis Class Generalization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, p.59 footnote 7 learning note; local finite-class union-bound proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"59"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"85"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference_before_R6","html":"p.66 learning note; printed 66 / PDF 92"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为有限非空实例空间，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 为其上概率分布；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^X\">\\(\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^X\\)</span> 为有限非空类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathcal H\">\\(c\\in\\mathcal H\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=((X_i,c(X_i)))_{i=1}^m\">\\(S=((X_i,c(X_i)))_{i=1}^m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_i\">\\(X_i\\)</span> 独立服从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可随机，但每次运行输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(S)\\in\\mathcal H\">\\(A(S)\\in\\mathcal H\\)</span> 且与全部样本一致。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon,\\delta\\in(0,1)\">\\(\\varepsilon,\\delta\\in(0,1)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{err}_D(h,c)=\\sum_{x\\in X}D(x)\\mathbf1[h(x)\\ne c(x)]\">\\(\\operatorname{err}_D(h,c)=\\sum_{x\\in X}D(x)\\mathbf1[h(x)\\ne c(x)]\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pr_{S,A}[\\operatorname{err}_D(A(S),c)&gt;\\varepsilon]\\le|\\mathcal H|(1-\\varepsilon)^m\\le|\\mathcal H|e^{-\\varepsilon m}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pr_{S,A}[\\operatorname{err}_D(A(S),c)&gt;\\varepsilon]\\le|\\mathcal H|(1-\\varepsilon)^m\\le|\\mathcal H|e^{-\\varepsilon m}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m\\ge\\frac{\\ln|\\mathcal H|+\\ln(1/\\delta)}{\\varepsilon}\\Rightarrow\\Pr_{S,A}[\\operatorname{err}_D(A(S),c)&gt;\\varepsilon]\\le\\delta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m\\ge\\frac{\\ln|\\mathcal H|+\\ln(1/\\delta)}{\\varepsilon}\\Rightarrow\\Pr_{S,A}[\\operatorname{err}_D(A(S),c)&gt;\\varepsilon]\\le\\delta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>对每个坏假设 h，全部 m 个样本均与它一致的概率为 (1−err_D(h,c))<sup>m≤(1−ε)</sup>m。对有限 H 用并合界，任何一致学习器输出坏假设的事件均包含在上述并集内；学习器的额外随机性不影响此包含。代入 m 界得到第二式。这是完整本地概率证明。原书 p.59 脚注7仅有 Occam/Valiant 学习背景，未定位直接定理陈述，故不把本条标成原书已核验定理。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：p.59 footnote 7 learning note; local finite-class union-bound proof，印刷页 59；PDF 页 85。原书未定位到本条的完整直接陈述；这是与书中主题相关的本地补充。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>R6来源纠正：直接读取PDF92确认该页为习题，实际Occam/Valiant背景在印刷59/PDF85脚注7。已更正当前定位并保留旧定位字段；本地有限类并合界仍不是原书直接定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^X","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathcal H","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"S=((X_i,c(X_i)))_{i=1}^m","display":false},{"tex":"X_i","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A(S)\\in\\mathcal H","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon,\\delta\\in(0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{err}_D(h,c)=\\sum_{x\\in X}D(x)\\mathbf1[h(x)\\ne c(x)]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr_{S,A}[\\operatorname{err}_D(A(S),c)>\\varepsilon]\\le|\\mathcal H|(1-\\varepsilon)^m\\le|\\mathcal H|e^{-\\varepsilon m}.","display":true},{"tex":"m\\ge\\frac{\\ln|\\mathcal H|+\\ln(1/\\delta)}{\\varepsilon}\\Rightarrow\\Pr_{S,A}[\\operatorname{err}_D(A(S),c)>\\varepsilon]\\le\\delta.","display":true}],"bytes":2312,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-182","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"学习理论：[[28-df-pac-learning]]、[[28-df-vc-dimension]]、[[28-thm-occam-learning]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}